<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Lords of the Fey</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/theme.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/mainmenu.css" />
</head>
<body class="fey-page">
{{> menuheader}}
<div class="main-content fey-shell">

<div class="fey-hero">
  <span class="fey-crest"></span>
  <h1 class="fey-title">Lords of the Fey</h1>
  <div class="fey-subtitle">Turn-based tactics on hexes of forest, hill and stone.</div>
  <div class="fey-rule"><span></span></div>
</div>

<div class="fey-panel fey-panel-wood fey-menu">
{{#if username}}
<div class="option"><a href="lobby" class="option">Enter the Lobby<span class="fey-tag">in development</span></a></div>
<div class="option"><a href="/gamelist" class="option">Your Campaigns</a></div>
{{else}}
<div class="option"><a href="/login.html" class="option">Log In</a></div>
<div class="option"><a href="/signup.html" class="option">Sign Up</a></div>
{{/if}}
</div>

<div class="fey-panel fey-panel-parchment fey-blurb">
Lords of the Fey is an attempt to recreate (something like) <a href="http://wesnoth.org">Battle for Wesnoth</a> for the browser. The game is under development.
</div>

<div class="fey-footnotes">
<p>Learn more at the <a href="https://github.com/apsillers/lords-of-the-fey">project's GitHub page</a> and <a href="https://github.com/apsillers/lords-of-the-fey/wiki">wiki</a>. Feel free to <strong><a href="https://github.com/apsillers/lords-of-the-fey/issues">open a bug report</a></strong> if you encounter any problems.</p>
